# Keep the build context small and never copy local state or secrets into an image.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
.git/
.github/
artifacts/

# Credentials and local overrides — these must never reach an image layer.
**/secrets.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
.env
.env.*
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.Local.json

# Docs and scratch
*.md
!README.md
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
